@startuml
title Test #5: public → public（业务变量重命名）

object "Before" as ib {
  publicStore:
    old_name = "data"
    new_name = <unset>
}

object "After" as ia {
  publicStore:
    old_name = "data" (unchanged)
    new_name = "data"
}

ib ..> ia : executeMove(\n  from={kind:'public', name:'old_name'}\n  to  ={kind:'public', name:'new_name'}\n)

note right of ib
  **前置**
  publicStore.set('old_name', 'data')
  **关键**
  验证 old_name 仍存在
end note

note right of ia
  **验证（两条都必）**
  publicStore.get('old_name') === 'data' ✓
  publicStore.get('new_name') === 'data' ✓
end note

@enduml
